+# ops-apply lane verbs (wq#4688, foreman design/orchestrator_verify_lane.md §3 option B
+# + §6). Reachable only with an `apply` / `docker_exec` grant entry, which only the
+# ops-apply lane spawner mints (foreman harness/ops_apply_lane.py) after its five gates
