+"""wq#4688 (foreman design/orchestrator_verify_lane.md §3 option B + §6): the two
+ops-apply lane verbs — apply-staged and docker-exec-allowlisted — plus the
+ops_apply_staged backup/patch/post-check module they share with the foreman spawner.
+
+apply-staged runs a REAL `git apply` against a scratch git repo; only ssh, the restart
+re-entry, ntfy and wq are faked. The headline case is the design's §7 exit criterion
+for option B: a staged patch that breaks the post-check is applied, detected, rolled
+back from the verified backup, and the ticket is blocked.
+
+Run: python3 -m pytest tests/test_fleet_exec_ops_apply.py -q
+"""
